            "review_title": "Review at Atelier Matcha",
            "review_text": "Kim H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam27 contributions\n0\nThe tea is very salty (umami).\nMar 2026 • Family\nAlthough it is also addicted to matcha, buy mushroom powder at home, but until now I have just tried Atelier :v This house I have bought the powder twice and it is too bitter so I am not excited, but I think outside the restaurant it will be better so still out.\nOne glass here is quite stable, ranging from 70-150k / cup, the cake is also that price. I vs you try 2 types of powder, feel like the tea is bitter, there is a lot of salty (umami?), but the taste is not impressive, it is still too bitter... The cake is quite okay, and the fever is periodic...\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 28, 2026",
